    "northStar": "The System Blueprint",
    "overview": "A dark-first engineering portfolio presented the way an engineer would build it: as a measured, drafted, verifiable system. Surfaces sit flat behind hairline borders; depth appears only on interaction; metadata is spoken in monospace readouts. The palette is ember on warm charcoal — flat, no gradients.",
